### Health check (liveness)
GET http://localhost:3000/healthz


### Readiness check
GET http://localhost:3000/readyz


### Valid ingestion request
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/chat/ingestion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_type": "chat",
  "user_id": "user_1",
  "room_id": "room_1",
  "payload": {
    "message": "hello world"
  },
  "producer_timestamp": 1700000000000
}


### Missing field (invalid request → 422)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/chat/ingestion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_type": "",
  "user_id": "user_1",
  "room_id": "room_1",
  "payload": {
    "message": "invalid"
  }
}


### Invalid payload type (not object → 422)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/chat/ingestion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_type": "chat",
  "user_id": "user_1",
  "room_id": "room_1",
  "payload": "this should be an object"
}


### Burst test (manual repeat)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/chat/ingestion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_type": "chat",
  "user_id": "user_{{$randomInt}}",
  "room_id": "room_hot",
  "payload": {
    "message": "burst traffic test"
  }
}